I’ve been enjoying this candle warmer a lot. It can be adjusted taller or shorter, and I’ve been playing with the temperature settings. If you don’t want to worry about it, for a small candle such as shown in the photo, set the temperature to “low” and set the timer to 2 hours. If you have small children or pets, use due caution and supervision, but I find this an attractive and useful warmer, with a small footprint and a slightly indented circular area which is helpful if the candle overwarms and melts.

